I agree mostly with these comments about taking it slow thanks to the
tons of food, but I've found the camera to be eminently helpful.  Not in
rooms, mainly, but in corridors.  I don't necessarily open all combats
with a camera blast, but if you're using missile weapons or want to run
away, there is no better way to do it.  If you're having trouble with a
monster, blast 'im and then throw those +2 darts until it is dead. 
Also, it negates the floating eyes' special attack (try it!) which is
quite handy indeed.

